<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's Colonial yr net profit A$120 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's Colonial yr net profit A$120 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian life office Colonial Ltd said on Thursday its net profit for calendar 1996 was A$120 million, down from a 1995 result of A$169 million.</p>
<p>The 1996 result was on a proforma restated basis, which assumes for accounting purposes the group's demutualisation last December actually occured on January 1, 1995, the company said.</p>
<p>Colonial also announced its Colonial State Bank business made an after tax profit of A$111 million for 1996, up from A$109 million in 1995.</p>
</text>
